  "content": "<div align=\"center\">\n\n# 更好的下界合金與SmithingCraft配方\n**一站式下界合金製作與Smithing模板配方**\n*無額外模組、無額外資料包，只需一個。*\n\n</div>\n\n<br/>\n\n<a href=\"https://fabricmc.net\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/supported/fabric_vector.svg\" alt=\"Fabric\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://neoforged.net\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/supported/neoforge_vector.svg\" alt=\"NeoForge\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://minecraftforge.net\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/supported/forge_vector.svg\" alt=\"Forge\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://quiltmc.org\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/supported/quilt_vector.svg\" alt=\"Quilt\"></a>\n\n<br/>\n\n![MC](https://img.shields.io/badge/🎮_MINECRAFT-1.20_–_1.21.11-1ABC9C?style=for-the-badge)\n![ENV](https://img.shields.io/badge/🖥️_Server_SIDE-2C3E50?style=for-the-badge)\n\n---\n\n> 🚨 **1.20 – 1.20.6 的 Alpha 版本可能無法正常運作。**\n> \n> 💡 為何要下載 **兩個模組/資料包**，而可以選擇 **一個** 取得？\n\n---\n\n## 依賴項 *(僅限Mod版本)*\n\n| Loader | Requires |\n|--------|----------|\n| <img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/supported/fabric_vector.svg\" alt=\"Fabric\" height=\"40\"> | <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/fabric-api\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/requires/fabric-api_vector.svg\" alt=\"Fabric API\" height=\"40\"></a> |\n| <img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/supported/quilt_vector.svg\" alt=\"Quilt\" height=\"40\"> | None |\n| <img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/supported/forge_vector.svg\" alt=\"Forge\" height=\"40\"> | None |\n| <img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/supported/neoforge_vector.svg\" alt=\"NeoForge\" height=\"40\"> | None |\n\n---\n\n## 下界合金Craft配方\n\n**無序配方** — 任意順序放置材料\n\n<div align=\"center\">\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/12a80343b0c2a8e2d1b154848d17df362903956a_0.webp\" width=\"480\"/>\n<br/><br/>\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/c36970e5a5db643d0a64ddb2977b8c1168c4047f_0.webp\" width=\"480\"/>\n</div>\n\n---\n\n## Smithing Template Craft配方 *(實際平衡，不同于用钻石的版本)*\n\n<div align=\"center\">\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/1724ddcee4904a85316b68ea7e45d9e317ebbd38.png\" width=\"480\"/>\n</div>\n\n---\n\n<summary>🗃️更多Smithing Template配方</summary>\n\n<br/>\n\n<div align=\"center\">\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/40b1b56fef14e8ffea6cb70d86a2941e23c8844a_0.webp\" width=\"480\"/>\n</div>",
